CUS -->|input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid; }| SAFE["SELECTIVE :FOCUS-VISIBLE RING PEACE ✦<br>──► Evaluates interaction event origin in RAM.<br>──► Suppresses intrusive outlines during mouse pointer clicks.<br>──► Activates high-contrast ring strictly during keyboard tab loops!"] ::: pos\n```',
